# 70. v1 Implementation Roadmap

---

# 1. Purpose

This document defines the strategic implementation roadmap for Loyalty Platform v1.0.

Unlike the Development Roadmap, which describes implementation phases, this roadmap focuses on business capability delivery, implementation milestones and overall project progression from Blueprint Freeze to Production.

It serves as the executive implementation plan for Product, Architecture, Engineering and Delivery teams.

---

# 2. Scope

This roadmap covers the complete implementation of Loyalty Platform v1.0, including:

- Core Platform
- Customer Experience
- Employee Experience
- Business Portal
- Platform Administration
- Infrastructure
- Security
- Production Rollout

Future roadmap items beyond v1.0 remain documented separately.

---

# 3. Roadmap Principles

The implementation roadmap follows these principles:

- Deliver Business Value Early
- Build Stable Foundations First
- Minimize Technical Risk
- Enable Parallel Development
- Maintain Production Readiness
- Preserve Architectural Integrity
- Validate Continuously
- Release Incrementally

---

