# 15. Parallel Workstreams

The roadmap supports multiple parallel workstreams.

### Product

- backlog refinement;
- acceptance preparation.

### Architecture

- ADRs;
- implementation reviews.

### Backend

- module implementation.

### Database

- migrations;
- RLS;
- functions.

### Mobile

- Customer App;
- Employee App.

### Portal

- Business Portal.

### QA

- automated tests;
- UAT preparation.

### DevOps

- CI/CD;
- infrastructure;
- monitoring.

Parallel work must respect module dependencies.

---

# 16. Critical Dependencies

The following capabilities are considered foundational.

Must be completed before downstream work:

- Authentication
- Customer Identity
- Business Hierarchy
- Membership
- Receipt Processing

Reward-related functionality depends on these capabilities.

---

# 17. Quality Milestones

Every milestone requires completion of:

- Definition of Task Ready;
- Definition of Done;
- mandatory reviews;
- mandatory testing;
- documentation updates;
- implementation evidence.

Incomplete quality gates prevent milestone completion.

---

